      "slug": "django-deploy",
      "title": "在Ubuntu上通过Nginx, uWSGI部署Django项目",
      "destination": "content/post/django-deploy.md",
      "date": "2019-04-02T23:39:50+09:00",
      "imported": true,
      "sources": [
        {
          "repository": "old_benzenoil.github.io",
          "branch": "master",
          "commit": "c8650c6d6bee76e054490fb6bae699ebdff5fb52",
          "path": "2019/04/02/django-deploy/index.html",
          "url": "https://github.com/Benzenoil/old_benzenoil.github.io/blob/c8650c6d6bee76e054490fb6bae699ebdff5fb52/2019/04/02/django-deploy/index.html",
          "sha256": "fd8397eeebbe7e8ebacf83b8e3c57f2259b8c77dcd61c0515fc94b2b02a9e2d1"
        },
        {
          "repository": "old_benzenoil.github.io",
          "branch": "hexo",
          "commit": "7c8e5c8943fbc126e00190bb3258e1648912c476",
          "path": "2019/04/02/django-deploy/index.html",
          "url": "https://github.com/Benzenoil/old_benzenoil.github.io/blob/7c8e5c8943fbc126e00190bb3258e1648912c476/2019/04/02/django-deploy/index.html",
          "sha256": "4fbb5edecc12ae147f3c816df58ab53e3985d53045dc33ac57b715ecb9cc3db3"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "code_blocks": [
        "$ apt-get update\n$ apt-get upgrade",
        "$ apt-get install build-essential libtool\n$ apt-get install libpcre3 libpcre3-dev zlib1g-dev openssl",
        "$ apt-get install python3.7\n$ apt-get install python3-pip",
        "$ mkdir -p /www/project/env\n$ mkdir -p /www/project/firstpage",
        "# virtualenv -p [python路径] [项目路径]\n$ virtualenv -p /usr/bin/python3 /www/project/env/firstpage",
        "$ source /www/project/env/firstpage/bin/activate",
        "$ pip install django\n$ cd /www/project/\n$ django-admin startproject firstpage\n$ cd firstpage",
        "$ python manage.py migrate\n$ python manage.py runserver",
        "Django version 2.2, using settings 'firstpage.settings'\nStarting development server at http://127.0.0.1:8000/\nQuit the server with CONTROL-C.",
        "# pip install uwsgi",
        "# test.py\ndef application(env, start_response):\n    start_response('200 OK', [('Content-Type','text/html')])\n    return [b\"Hello World\"]",
        "$ uwsgi --http :8000 --wsgi-file test.py",
        "thw web client < -- > uWSGI < -- > Python App",
        "$ uwsgi --http :8000 --wsgi-file /www/project/firstpage/firstpage/wsgi.py",
        "DisallowedHost at /\nInvalid HTTP_HOST header: ..... You may need to add \"你的域名\" to ALLOWED_HOSTS",
        "$ cd firstpage\n$ vi settings.py",
        "ALLOWED_HOSTS = ['XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX']",
        "$ uwsgi --http :8000 --wsgi-file /www/project/firstpage/firstpage/wsgi.py",
        "$ mkdir -p /etc/uwsgi/sites\n$ vi /etc/uwsgi/sites/firstpage.ini",
        "[uwsgi]\nchdir = /www/project/firstpage  # 项目目录\nhome = /www/project/env/firstpage  # 虚拟环境目录\nwsgi-file = %(chdir)/firstpage/wsgi.py  # wsgi文件位置\n\nmaster = true\nprocesses = 4\n\nsocket = /run/uwsgi/firstpage.sock  # sock存储位置\nchmod-socket = 666\nvacuum = true",
        "$ vi /etc/systemd/system/uwsgi.service",
        "[Unit]\nDescription=uWSGI Emperor service\n\n[Service]\nExecStartPre=/bin/bash -c 'mkdir -p /run/uwsgi; chown root:www-data /run/uwsgi'\nExecStart=/usr/local/bin/uwsgi --emperor /etc/uwsgi/sites\nRestart=always\nKillSignal=SIGQUIT\nType=notify\nNotifyAccess=all\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=multi-user.target",
        "$ apt-get install nginx\n$ /etc/init.d/nginx start    # start nginx",
        "the web client < -- > the web server",
        "$ vi /etc/nginx/sites-available/firstpage",
        "# firstpage\n\nserver {\n        listen 8000;\n        server_name xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx; # 你的域名\n\n        location = /favicon.ico { access_log off; log_not_found off; }\n        location /static/ {\n                alias /www/project/firstpage/static;\n        }\n\n        location / {\n                include /etc/nginx/uwsgi_params;\n                uwsgi_pass      unix:/run/uwsgi/firstpage.sock;\n        }\n}",
        "$ ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/firstpage /etc/nginx/sites-enabled\n# 若需要覆盖文件，可使用\n$ ln -s -f ...",
        "$ nginx -t",
        "$ systemctl restart nginx\n$ systemctl start uwsgi",
        "$ deactivate",
        "$ pip3 install django\n$ pip3 install uwsgi",
        "$ systemctl enable nginx\n$ systemctl enable uwsgi"
      ],
      "review": {
        "score": 7,
        "recommendation": "作为历史学习记录保留",
        "reason": "有完整排错过程，值得保留；文中 Ubuntu 18.04、Django 2.2、全局安装与 root 操作不能直接当今天的部署指南，发布前注明历史版本。"
      }
    },
